<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica money mkt shortage stays above 10 bln Fri.</title>
<headline>SAfrica money mkt shortage stays above 10 bln Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage eased to 10.139 billion rand on Friday from 10.167 billion rand on Thursday, the Reserve Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
